OL,3,GNEWSACar and moped seized after drivers
OL,4,Aignore lollipop man
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have seized a car and a moped
OL,7,Fafter their drivers failed to stop for
OL,8,Fa lollipop man on two separate
OL,9,Foccasions, forcing him to leap out of
OL,10,Fthe way.
OL,12,FBarry Jones was standing in Bury Old
OL,13,FRoad in Heywood, Greater Manchester,
OL,14,Fwhen the incidents happened on 13 and
OL,15,F14 October, Rochdale Borough Council
OL,16,Fsaid.
OL,18,FNobody was injured in either incident.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
